    \ (per entry.json):\n  - lineage: string\n  - metric:  string\n\nArtifact fields (any one alias per group is sufficient):\n  - metrics:\n      canonical: hinge_metrics\n      aliases:   metrics_csv, metrics, edge_metrics\n  - summary:\n      canonical: hinge_summary\n      aliases:   summary, summary_txt, summary_path\n  - panel:\n      canonical: panel\n      aliases:   boundary_panel, panel_png, panel_path\n\nOptional fields (not required, but validated if present):\n  - provenance, readme, notes, events_csv, input_csv\n\nPaths:\n  - Absolute or relative to the entry.json folder are both allowed.\n  - Relative paths are resolved against the directory of entry.json.\n\nRecommended:\n  - Use canonical names when possible (hinge_metrics, hinge_summary, panel).\n  - Include provenance.json and a brief README.md with usage and notes.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n\
