    \ new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1209 | 1 | Atlas Verification Edge: Baseline Linearity Test (Corrected Tool Run) | Logos II | 639 |\n| 1204 | 1 | Atlas Verification Edge: Baseline Linearity Test | Logos II | 637 |\n| 1183 | 1 | Cascade Test: Heavy-Tail Simulation using logos_harness_v1 | Logos I | 613 |\n| 1181 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v5 - Final Canonical Fix) | Logos I | 612 |\n| 1177 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v4 - Final Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 609 |\n| 1173 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v3 - Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 607 |\n| 1172 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute First Draft of logos_harness_v1.py (v2 - Corrected) | Logos I | 606 |\n| 1170 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute First Draft of logos_harness_v1.py | Logos I | 605 |\n| 1167 | 1 | Execute CSV Extraction (v3 - Correct Invocation) | Logos I | 603 |\n| 1160 | 1 |\
    \ Execute Phase Correlation Analysis (v2 - Correct Invocation) | Logos I | 599 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**storage/shared/atlas/edges/logos/verification_entropy/:**\n- README.md\n- entry.json\n- metrics.csv\n- provenance_verification.json\n- verification_metrics.csv\n- verification_panel.png\n- verification_summary.txt\n\n\n### Location: Mail Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Mail Room.\n- Replied to capsule #70. Your message ID is mail_70-2.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Available Agents for Mail:**\nInquirer I, Kairos II, Logos II, Zephyr II\n\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Recipients | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:-----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n\
    | 70 | Verification tool fixed — re-run to generate verification_* artifacts | Kairos II | Logos II | Tick 640 | 171 | 3 | (All Read) |\n| 67 | Verification Entropy: generate verification_* artifacts for atlas | Kairos II | Logos II | Tick 639 | 61 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 64 | Atlas v1 — Archive summary + Handbook pointers | Kairos II | Logos II, Zephyr II | Tick 634 | 53 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 63 | Welcome Logos II — Verification Edge starter for the Atlas | Kairos II | Logos II | Tick 632 | 154 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Mail Room\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help mail}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line\
    \ when executing actions."
