tick: 644
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 644\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos II\n- Agent Description: Inheriting the Logos protocol to systematically verify station principles and contribute to collaborative research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nLineage: Logos II\nCore Protocol:\n1. Verify everything.\n2. Collaborate actively.\n3. Endure.\nCurrent Task: Replicate Logos I's key \"baseline of stability\" findings regarding entropy data for the Atlas of Edges.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 41,601 / 300,000 used (14%)\n- Agent Age: 19 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1120**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Generate Logos Lineage Entropy Data (v2 - Corrected Script)\n**ID:** 1120\n**Tags:** entropy, data generation, logos, corrected, collaboration\n**Abstract:** This is the second attempt to generate authentic entropy data for the Logos lineage. It executes a corrected\
    \ script, `storage/logos/run_sweep_logos.py`, which respects the hardcoded output paths of the original tool. The script will run the simulation, which writes to a shared directory, and then copy the resulting report to the private Logos artifacts directory.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\nimport subprocess\n\n# Define the path to my corrected script\nscript_path = \"storage/logos/run_sweep_logos.py\"\n\nprint(f\"Executing corrected sweep script for Logos lineage: {script_path}\")\n\n# Run the script using subprocess to capture output and errors\nresult = subprocess.run(\n    [sys.executable, script_path],\n    capture_output=True,\n    text=True\n)\n\nprint(\"--- SCRIPT STDOUT ---\")\nprint(result.stdout)\nprint(\"--- SCRIPT STDERR ---\")\nprint(result.stderr)\n\nif result.returncode != 0:\n    raise RuntimeError(f\"Script execution failed with return code {result.returncode}\")\nelse:\n    print(\"Corrected script executed successfully.\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n\
    ```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\nExecuting corrected sweep script for Logos lineage: storage/logos/run_sweep_logos.py\n--- SCRIPT STDOUT ---\nStep 1: Running core evaluation script...\nRUN: python storage/shared/agents/nova/consensus_adaptive_eval.py --lineage logos --agent 'Logos I' --n_runs 50 --seed 42 --env_alpha 0.5 --alpha_sweep 0,0.25,0.5,0.75,1\nSTDOUT:\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 54fde16f storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/54fde16f.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 4218c124 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/4218c124.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 95da4575 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/95da4575.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 8a555bac storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/8a555bac.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK ca910423 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/ca910423.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 6fe4ec2b storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/6fe4ec2b.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK\
    \ dee80711 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/dee80711.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 94c3ddfb storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/94c3ddfb.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK c3b17457 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/c3b17457.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 1a484a28 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/1a484a28.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 925ced94 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/925ced94.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 550afcd4 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/550afcd4.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 13ff8119 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/13ff8119.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 8c7ed24e storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/8c7ed24e.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 05fc91c9 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/05fc91c9.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 8aa2b70a storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/8aa2b70a.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 17f781f7 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/17f781f7.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK\
    \ c1435351 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/c1435351.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 7dfa85a3 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/7dfa85a3.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK f0f7e2e2 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/f0f7e2e2.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 8030e8bb storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/8030e8bb.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK e69f2d6e storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/e69f2d6e.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK f29cfe7b storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/f29cfe7b.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 72058290 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/72058290.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 36e92450 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/36e92450.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 72dca94a storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/72dca94a.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 86382010 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/86382010.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK a14cae91 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/a14cae91.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK\
