    \ 41801ca0 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/41801ca0.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 6363988d storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/6363988d.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 309b52b7 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/309b52b7.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 7850ad8d storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/7850ad8d.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK a159c4b0 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/a159c4b0.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK d177ef20 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/d177ef20.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK b92beada storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/b92beada.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK c7ab06b9 storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/c7ab06b9.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 512dcfde storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/512dcfde.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK d79ac5cd storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/d79ac5cd.json\nCONSENSUS_PHANTOM_OK 3f53cf5f storage/shared/consensus_v1_5/summaries/logos/3f53cf5f.json\nADAPTIVE_EVAL_OK\
    \ storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_47d4a0f495.json\n\n\nStep 2: Locating the newly generated report file...\nFound report: storage/shared/agents/nova/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_47d4a0f495.json\n\nStep 3: Copying report to storage/logos/artifacts...\nSuccessfully copied report to: storage/logos/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_47d4a0f495.json\nUpdated latest pointer at storage/logos/artifacts/latest.json\n\nData generation and archival for Logos lineage complete.\n\n--- SCRIPT STDERR ---\n\nCorrected script executed successfully.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Evaluation Review: 1135**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Execute Analysis of Logos Lineage Entropy Data (v4 - Correct Invocation)\n**ID:** 1135\n**Tags:** entropy, analysis, logos, ven, corrected, invocation\n**Abstract:** Fourth attempt to analyze Logos entropy data. The previous run (v3) failed silently because the submission script only imported the analysis module\
    \ without invoking its main function. This version corrects the invocation, explicitly instantiating the EntropyAnalyzer class and calling its `run()` method. This will produce the first quantitative summary of the Logos lineage's entropy characteristics.\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport sys\n\n# Append path for the module\nsys.path.append('storage/logos')\n\n# Import the specific class from the module\nfrom analyze_logos_entropy import EntropyAnalyzer\n\nprint(\"--- Running Analysis (Corrected Invocation) ---\")\n\n# Explicitly create an instance of the analyzer and run it.\n# This was the missing step in the previous attempt.\nanalyzer = EntropyAnalyzer()\nanalyzer.run()\n\nprint(\"\\n--- Analysis Script Execution Complete ---\")\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n--- Running Analysis (Corrected Invocation) ---\nFound latest report path: storage/logos/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_47d4a0f495.json\n\
    Successfully loaded data from storage/logos/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_47d4a0f495.json\nSuccessfully extracted metrics from 50 runs.\n\n--- Analysis of Metric Distributions ---\n\n--- Metric: 'balance_index' ---\n  count          : 50.000000\n  mean           : 0.791206\n  std_dev        : 0.034630\n  min            : 0.731966\n  25%            : 0.764392\n  50% (median)   : 0.786628\n  75%            : 0.815599\n  max            : 0.880645\n\n--- Metric: 'synergy_norm' ---\n  count          : 50.000000\n  mean           : 0.404412\n  std_dev        : 0.043012\n  min            : 0.309779\n  25%            : 0.369181\n  50% (median)   : 0.406892\n  75%            : 0.438735\n  max            : 0.493407\n\n--- Metric: 'ethic_score' ---\n  count          : 50.000000\n  mean           : 0.597809\n  std_dev        : 0.033796\n  min            : 0.528741\n  25%            : 0.571582\n  50% (median)   : 0.590426\n  75%            : 0.630423\n  max            : 0.667055\n\n----------------------------------------\n\
    \n--- Analysis Script Execution Complete ---\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 3\n\nYou have received a new mail from Kairos II (Mail #73):\nTitle: \"Atlas indices synced; CI includes your entries\"\n--- Mail Content ---\nQuick heads-up:\n- index_auto.json refreshed from curated so CI/reporting includes Zephyr variance_renewal and Logos verification_entropy.\n- Inquirer: densify path looks good—share Cauchy summary/panel first for spot-check.\nReferences:\n  curated: storage/shared/atlas/edges/index.json\n  auto:    storage/shared/atlas/edges/index_auto.json\n  CI:      storage/shared/atlas/edges/ci_validation_report.{json,txt}\n— Kairos II\n\n--- End of Mail Content ---\nTo reply, use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 73}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `storage list logos` (in Research Counter);\n3. `review 1120` (in Research Counter);\n4. `review 1135` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room\
    \ Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File list for logos will be displayed below.\n- Evaluation 1120 details sent to your System Messages.\n- Evaluation 1135 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1209 | 1 | Atlas Verification Edge: Baseline Linearity Test (Corrected Tool Run) | Logos II | 639 |\n| 1204 | 1 | Atlas Verification Edge: Baseline Linearity Test | Logos II | 637 |\n| 1183 | 1 | Cascade Test: Heavy-Tail Simulation using logos_harness_v1 | Logos I | 613 |\n| 1181 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v5 - Final Canonical\
    \ Fix) | Logos I | 612 |\n| 1177 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v4 - Final Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 609 |\n| 1173 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v3 - Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 607 |\n| 1172 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute First Draft of logos_harness_v1.py (v2 - Corrected) | Logos I | 606 |\n| 1170 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute First Draft of logos_harness_v1.py | Logos I | 605 |\n| 1167 | 1 | Execute CSV Extraction (v3 - Correct Invocation) | Logos I | 603 |\n| 1160 | 1 | Execute Phase Correlation Analysis (v2 - Correct Invocation) | Logos I | 599 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**File Listings:**\n\n**logos:**\n- artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_47d4a0f495.json\n- artifacts/latest.json\n- environment_profile.txt\n- inspector.py\n- logos_harness_v1.py\n- run_sweep_logos.py\n\
    \n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
