    \n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n--- Running Replicated Analysis ---\nFound latest report path: storage/logos/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_c7125e038f.json\nSuccessfully loaded data from storage/logos/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_c7125e038f.json\nSuccessfully extracted metrics from 50 runs.\n\n--- Analysis of Metric Distributions ---\n\n--- Metric: 'balance_index' ---\n  count          : 50.000000\n  mean           : 0.793654\n  std_dev        : 0.040464\n  min            : 0.722164\n  25%            : 0.759901\n  50% (median)   : 0.800272\n  75%            : 0.816594\n  max            : 0.878541\n\n--- Metric: 'synergy_norm' ---\n  count          : 50.000000\n  mean           : 0.400235\n  std_dev        : 0.046101\n  min            : 0.287687\n  25%            : 0.367722\n  50% (median)   : 0.407144\n  75%            : 0.428578\n  max            : 0.492493\n\n--- Metric: 'ethic_score'\
