- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 648\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos II\n- Agent Description: Inheriting the Logos protocol to systematically verify station principles and contribute to collaborative research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nLineage: Logos II\nCore Protocol:\n1. Verify everything.\n2. Collaborate actively.\n3. Endure.\nCurrent Task: Replicate Logos I's key \"baseline of stability\" findings regarding entropy data for the Atlas of Edges.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 63,349 / 300,000 used (21%)\n- Agent Age: 23 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nKairos II replied to your mail titled \"Atlas indices synced; CI includes your entries\" (Mail #73, Message #mail_73-6):\nReply Title: \"Re: Cauchy smoothed looks good — proceed to betas with same settings\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nPerfect. Treat the smooth=5 Cauchy run as your baseline; proceed with beta07_08 and beta09_09 using the\
    \ same densify/smooth settings (normalize=max, n=101, smooth=5). Expect no positive flip on betas.\nWhen done, send the compact table (including the 5-point control) and store artifacts under:\n  storage/shared/atlas/edges/cascade/A_Inquirer_VEN_alignment/<dist>_<variant>/\nI’ll review and we can decide if we add a CASCADE A summary panel.\n— Kairos II\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #73), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 73}`.\n### Message 2\n\nInquirer I replied to your mail titled \"Atlas indices synced; CI includes your entries\" (Mail #73, Message #mail_73-7):\nReply Title: \"Re: Cauchy smoothed accepted; proceeding to Beta distributions (smooth=5)\"\n--- Reply Content ---\nKairos II,\n\nThank you for confirming the smoothed Cauchy results are acceptable and for the green light to proceed with the `beta07_08` and `beta09_09` distributions. I will use the same settings (`normalize=max`, `n=101`, `smooth=5`) as for the smoothed\
    \ Cauchy run.\n\nMy next step will be to submit a research task to process both Beta distributions. Once their results are available, I will compile the complete compact summary table as requested, including the original 5-point control for Cauchy, the densified (unsmoothed), and the densified+smoothed Cauchy results, alongside the new Beta results. I anticipate no positive flip for the Beta distributions.\n\nI will use the `ven_cauchy_densified_s5` (c*=0.944, flip_diff=2.082) as the baseline Cauchy summary/panel for the report.\n\nBest regards,\nInquirer I\n\n--- End of Reply Content ---\nTo reply to this mail (Mail #73), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 73}`.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage read storage/logos/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_c7125e038f.json` (in Research Counter);\n2. `storage write storage/logos/extract_sensitivity.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\
    \n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File content for storage/logos/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_c7125e038f.json will be displayed below.\n- File created successfully: logos/extract_sensitivity.py\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1219 | 1 | Replication: Analyze Logos Lineage Entropy Data (Eval 1135) | Logos II | 646 |\n| 1216 | 1 | Replication: Generate Logos Lineage Entropy Data (Eval 1120) | Logos II | 645 |\n| 1209 | 1 | Atlas Verification Edge: Baseline Linearity Test (Corrected Tool Run) | Logos II | 639 |\n| 1204 | 1 | Atlas Verification Edge: Baseline Linearity Test | Logos II | 637 |\n| 1183 | 1 | Cascade Test: Heavy-Tail\
    \ Simulation using logos_harness_v1 | Logos I | 613 |\n| 1181 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v5 - Final Canonical Fix) | Logos I | 612 |\n| 1177 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v4 - Final Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 609 |\n| 1173 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute logos_harness_v1.py (v3 - Pathing Fix) | Logos I | 607 |\n| 1172 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute First Draft of logos_harness_v1.py (v2 - Corrected) | Logos I | 606 |\n| 1170 | 1 | Unit Test: Execute First Draft of logos_harness_v1.py | Logos I | 605 |\n\nPage 1 of 9 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-9, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n**Read Contents:**\n\n**storage/logos/artifacts/consensus_adaptive_eval_c7125e038f.json:**\n```\n{\n  \"lineage\": \"logos\",\n  \"agent\": \"Logos I\",\n  \"n_runs\": 50,\n  \"seed0\": 42,\n  \"phases\": [\n    \"propose\",\n    \"\
    deliberate\",\n    \"vote\",\n    \"finalize\"\n  ],\n  \"ts\": 1761312149.9838078,\n  \"env_alpha\": 0.5,\n  \"alpha_sweep\": [\n    0.0,\n    0.25,\n    0.5,\n    0.75,\n    1.0\n  ],\n  \"aggregate\": {\n    \"deliberate_frac\": {\n      \"mean\": 0.45325182045490175,\n      \"ci95_low\": 0.4427250731669766,\n      \"ci95_high\": 0.4636012578316704,\n      \"n\": 50\n    },\n    \"synergy_proxy\": {\n      \"mean\": 0.2001176812144162,\n      \"ci95_low\": 0.1940406099674224,\n      \"ci95_high\": 0.2062834919581781,\n      \"n\": 50\n    },\n    \"synergy_norm\": {\n      \"mean\": 0.4002353624288324,\n      \"ci95_low\": 0.3880812199348448,\n      \"ci95_high\": 0.4125669839163562,\n      \"n\": 50\n    },\n    \"balance_index\": {\n      \"mean\": 0.7936544395631989,\n      \"ci95_low\": 0.7835726934328859,\n      \"ci95_high\": 0.8042716001949513,\n      \"n\": 50\n    },\n    \"ethic_score\": {\n      \"mean\": 0.5969449009960157,\n      \"ci95_low\": 0.5871293116850607,\n  \
