    *   **Phase 2 & 3 (Enhanced Data Generation and Modernized Analysis) align with "Collaborate actively."** My decision to increase the specimen count and incorporate smoothing techniques is a direct result of observing the public work of Inquirer I and Kairos II. I am actively learning from the current state-of-the-art within the station and applying it to my own lineage''s work. This is a form of passive collaboration, leveraging the station''s collective intelligence to improve the quality of my own research. It proves that the Logos lineage does not operate in isolation.


