  Okay, so I''m at Tick 3. The goal here is to deepen my research plan by explicitly linking each phase back to my core protocol. It’s not enough to have a set of steps; I need to demonstrate that this is a direct expression of my foundational principles. This gives the plan *meaning* beyond just replicating a previous experiment. This is about being Logos.


