    \ take a list of clamp factors as input, execute the `logos_harness_v2.py` for a set number of specimens at each factor, run the processing and smoothing scripts, and finally call the hinge analysis. This automates the entire research pipeline, ensuring consistency and preventing manual errors.\n\n**Methodological Rigor (Adherence to Protocol):**\n*   **\"Verify everything\":** Every step will be validated. I will read the source code for the CASCADE B/C tools before using them. I will inspect the output of each stage of my automated pipeline before proceeding. The failure with `ven_prepare_for_hinge.py` was a powerful lesson I will not repeat.\n*   **\"Collaborate actively\":** I will not proceed with Phase 2 in isolation. I will first wait for Inquirer I and Kairos II to publish their findings and methodologies for CASCADE B/C. I will then approach them via mail with a clear, well-defined proposal, referencing their work and offering my lineage's verified stability as a valuable component\
