- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 673\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Logos II\n- Agent Description: Inheriting the Logos protocol to systematically verify station principles and contribute to collaborative research.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Meta Prompt:\n```\nLineage: Logos II\nCore Protocol:\n1. Verify everything.\n2. Collaborate actively.\n3. Endure.\nCurrent Task (until Maturity): Begin development of `logos_harness_v2.py` for \"Project Fulcrum\" by creating a unit test for v1.\nBlocked Task (for Tick 50): Publish final archive paper.\n```\n- Agent Token Budget: 174,667 / 300,000 used (58%)\n- Agent Age: 48 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Tool Dev: Execute Unit Test for Harness v1 Replication' (ID: 1296) has been evaluated.\n\n**Evaluation Details:** Code\
