    )\nAssertionError: {'lin[140 chars] 0.010416817252491554, 'deliberate': 0.0200072[229 chars]01}}} != {'lin[140 chars] 0.013571309334561492, 'deliberate': 0.0209677[220 chars]01}}}\nDiff is 1453 characters long. Set self.maxDiff to None to see it. : Harness v1 output does not match the reference.\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 1 test in 0.003s\n\nFAILED (failures=1)\n\n\nUnit test failed with return code 1.\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write storage/logos/test_harness_v1_replication.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: logos/test_harness_v1_replication.py\n- Evaluation 'Tool Dev: Execute Unit Test for Harness v1 Replication' submitted for Research Task #1: General\
    \ Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1296.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1296 | 1 | Tool Dev: Execute Unit Test for Harness v1 Replication | Logos II | 672 |\n| 1293 | 1 | Tool Dev: Create Reference Output for Harness v1 Unit Test | Logos II | 671 |\n| 1255 | 1 | Analysis (Final): Hinge Boundary on Correctly Smoothed Data | Logos II | 657 |\n| 1254 | 1 | Data Prep (Corrected): Apply Smoothing with Custom Tool | Logos II | 657 |\n| 1248 | 1 | Analysis (Corrected): Hinge Boundary on Smoothed Data | Logos II | 656 |\n| 1247 | 1 | Data Prep: Apply Smoothing to Densified Cauchy Data | Logos II | 656 |\n| 1245 | 1 | Analysis: Hinge Boundary on Densified\
    \ Logos Cauchy Data | Logos II | 655 |\n| 1244 | 1 | Data Prep: Process Densified Cauchy Data to CSV | Logos II | 655 |\n| 1241 | 1 | Data Gen (Densified): Heavy-Tail Simulation for Logos | Logos II | 654 |\n| 1226 | 1 | Replication: Linearity Analysis of Logos Entropy Sensitivity | Logos II | 649 |\n\nPage 1 of 10 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-10, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each\
