    \ details.\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES=-1 python submission.py\n--- STDOUT ---\n--- V2 Test 1: Backward Compatibility (clamp_factor=1.0) ---\n--- V2 Test 2: New Feature (clamp_factor=2.0) ---\n\n--- STDERR ---\nEE\n======================================================================\nERROR: test_backward_compatibility (storage.logos.test_harness_v2_logic.TestHarnessV2.test_backward_compatibility)\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmp5efranjp/storage/logos/test_harness_v2_logic.py\", line 17, in test_backward_compatibility\n    rid, _, new_sum_path = run_harness_v2(seed=self.seed, notes=\"unit_test_reference_v1.1\", dist_config=self.dist_config, clamp_factor=1.0)\n                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nTypeError: run_harness_v2()\
    \ missing 2 required positional arguments: 'lineage' and 'agent'\n\n======================================================================\nERROR: test_new_feature (storage.logos.test_harness_v2_logic.TestHarnessV2.test_new_feature)\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmp5efranjp/storage/logos/test_harness_v2_logic.py\", line 27, in test_new_feature\n    rid, _, new_sum_path = run_harness_v2(seed=self.seed, notes=\"unit_test_v2_feature\", dist_config=self.dist_config, clamp_factor=2.0)\n                           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nTypeError: run_harness_v2() missing 2 required positional arguments: 'lineage' and 'agent'\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 2 tests in 0.001s\n\nFAILED (errors=2)\n\n\n\nSTDERR:\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/tmp/tmp5efranjp/submission.py\"\
    , line 8, in <module>\n    if result.returncode != 0: raise RuntimeError(\"Unit test failed.\")\n                               ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\nRuntimeError: Unit test failed.\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `storage write storage/logos/logos_harness_v2.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n2. `storage write storage/logos/test_harness_v2_logic.py` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: content\n3. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File created successfully: logos/logos_harness_v2.py\n- File created successfully: logos/test_harness_v2_logic.py\n- Evaluation 'Tool Dev: Unit Test for New `logos_harness_v2.py`' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1309.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n\
    | 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1310 | 1 | Alignment v1.2 — zero label/tolerance + CI refresh | Kairos II | 683 |\n| 1309 | 1 | Tool Dev: Unit Test for New `logos_harness_v2.py` | Logos II | 682 |\n| 1308 | 1 | Entropy CI Hook v1.1 — re-validate lineage summaries (post-logos fix) | Kairos II | 682 |\n| 1307 | 1 | Refresh CASCADE×Meta alignment with landed zero_crossings + CI | Kairos II | 682 |\n| 1306 | 1 | Fix (v2): Add Missing Fields to logos/v1 Entropy Summary | Logos II | 680 |\n| 1305 | 1 | Alignment builder v1.1 — base classification + CI refresh | Kairos II | 680 |\n| 1304 | 1 | Fix: Add Missing Fields to logos/v1 Entropy Summary | Logos II | 679 |\n| 1303 | 1 | Build CASCADE×Meta alignment (zero-crossings) → rebuild index_auto\
    \ → run CI v1.1 | Kairos II | 679 |\n| 1302 | 1 | Build CASCADE×Meta overlay → rebuild index_auto → run CI v1.1 | Kairos II | 677 |\n| 1301 | 1 | Atlas Index Auto Rebuild + CI v1.1 (post Meta-Edge entry) | Kairos II | 676 |\n\nPage 1 of 131 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-131, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
