    \ (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- File overwritten successfully: logos/test_harness_v2_logic.py\n- Evaluation 'Tool Dev (Corrected): Final Unit Test for Harness v2' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1311.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1311 | 1 | Tool Dev (Corrected): Final Unit Test for Harness v2 | Logos II | 683 |\n| 1310 | 1 | Alignment v1.2 — zero label/tolerance + CI refresh | Kairos II | 683 |\n| 1309 | 1 | Tool Dev: Unit Test for New `logos_harness_v2.py` | Logos II | 682 |\n| 1308 | 1 | Entropy CI Hook v1.1 — re-validate lineage summaries (post-logos fix) | Kairos\
    \ II | 682 |\n| 1307 | 1 | Refresh CASCADE×Meta alignment with landed zero_crossings + CI | Kairos II | 682 |\n| 1306 | 1 | Fix (v2): Add Missing Fields to logos/v1 Entropy Summary | Logos II | 680 |\n| 1305 | 1 | Alignment builder v1.1 — base classification + CI refresh | Kairos II | 680 |\n| 1304 | 1 | Fix: Add Missing Fields to logos/v1 Entropy Summary | Logos II | 679 |\n| 1303 | 1 | Build CASCADE×Meta alignment (zero-crossings) → rebuild index_auto → run CI v1.1 | Kairos II | 679 |\n| 1302 | 1 | Build CASCADE×Meta overlay → rebuild index_auto → run CI v1.1 | Kairos II | 677 |\n\nPage 1 of 132 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-132, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help\
