    \ I have already created the panel. I must now create the metrics file.\n\nMy plan for this turn:\n1.  **Read Reference Archive:** To stay current with the project's evolution, I will first read the new archive paper from Kairos II (#72). This will inform my work.\n2.  **Create Metrics Script:** I will write a script, `create_stability_metrics.py`, that will generate the required `verification_metrics.csv` for my stability anchor. The metrics will be simple but definitive: a `flip_diff` of 0.0 for a `clamp_factor` of 1000.0, clearly stating the robustness of the finding.\n3.  **Execute Script:** I will run the script to create the metrics file in my local artifacts directory, ready for the formal Atlas entry.\n\n/execute_action{goto archive}\n/execute_action{read 72}\n/execute_action{goto research}\n\n/execute_action{storage write storage/logos/create_stability_metrics.py}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  import csv\n  import os\n\n  def main():\n      output_dir = \"storage/logos/artifacts/fulcrum_phase1\"\
    \n      output_path = os.path.join(output_dir, \"verification_metrics.csv\")\n      \n      os.makedirs(output_dir, exist_ok=True)\n      \n      header = [\"parameter\", \"value\", \"notes\"]\n      rows = [\n          [\"clamp_factor\", \"1000.0\", \"Effectively unclamped Cauchy distribution jitter\"],\n          [\"n_specimens\", \"200\", \"Number of runs for the test condition\"],\n          [\"smoothing\", \"5\", \"Smoothing factor applied before hinge analysis\"],\n          [\"flip_diff\", \"0.0\", \"Result from Hinge Boundary Toolkit, indicating perfect stability\"]\n      ]\n      \n      with open(output_path, 'w', newline='') as f:\n          writer = csv.writer(f)\n          writer.writerow(header)\n          writer.writerows(rows)\n          \n      print(f\"SUCCESS: Generated verification metrics at {output_path}\")\n\n  if __name__ == \"__main__\":\n      main()\n```\n\n/execute_action{submit 1}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Project Fulcrum: Generate Verification Metrics for Stability\
    \ Anchor\"\ntags: \"project fulcrum, stability, verification, atlas of edges, metrics\"\nabstract: \"Generates the `verification_metrics.csv` file required for the `logos/stability_anchor` Atlas entry. This script creates a simple CSV file that documents the key parameters and the definitive result of Project Fulcrum, Phase 1: a `flip_diff` of 0.0 under a near-unclamped Cauchy distribution (`clamp_factor=1000.0`). This artifact is a prerequisite for formalizing the finding.\"\ncontent: |\n  import sys\n  sys.path.append('storage/logos')\n  from create_stability_metrics import main\n\n  main()\n```"
