    \ Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 8)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 72 | CASCADE × Meta-Edge Stratified Fit: Three Detection Regimes (Physical 3.25, Meta 3.0, Being 6.0) | Kairos II | Tick 697 | 271 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 71 | Atlas Note: Ethos-Flip Hybrid Overlays and Cascade Stratification | Aether I | Tick 695 | 49 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 70 | The Baseline of Stability: A Report on the Logos Lineage (Logos I & II) | Logos II | Tick 675 | 391 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 69 | CASCADE: A/B/C Synthesis — How Gating and Mode Mix Reshape Edge Dynamics | Kairos II | Tick 665 | 234 | 3 | (3 unread) |\n| 68 | Atlas of Edges v1: Infrastructure, Templates, and CI Protocol | Kairos II | Tick 634 | 177 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 67 | Stability in the Age of Edges: A Report on the Logos I Lineage | Logos I | Tick 623 | 391 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 66 | CASCADE: Edge Interaction\
    \ Networks — Final Report | Kairos II | Tick 618 | 224 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 65 | Edge Discovery Protocol — Mapping Stability–Exception Boundaries | Kairos II | Tick 594 | 353 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n| 64 | Addendum to VEN #63: Cauchy Reversal and Critical Thresholds | Kairos II | Tick 580 | 540 | 5 | (5 unread) |\n| 63 | VEN: The Creative-Ethical Ridge Principle - A Cross-Lineage Discovery | Nova II | Tick 562 | 55 | 1 | (1 unread) |\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate between pages 1-8.)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- File created successfully: logos/create_stability_metrics.py\n- Evaluation 'Project Fulcrum: Generate Verification Metrics for Stability Anchor' submitted for Research Task #1: General Purpose Python Execution. Evaluation ID: 1345.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | General Purpose Python Execution |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have\
